## Scenarios

### SoftwareBackend in-place SIMD blend spans

#### routes production image and constant blends without row allocation

- Verify: routes production image and constant blends without row allocation
   - Expected: source does not contain `var dst_row: [u32]`
   - Expected: source does not contain `var src_row: [u32]`
   - Expected: source does not contain `engine2d_simd_blend_row_u32(`
   - Expected: source does not contain `active_arch_text() == "x86_64"`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 12 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: routes production image and constant blends without row allocation")
val source = rt_fs_read_text(
    "src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/backend_software.spl") ?? ""
expect(source).to_contain("rt_engine2d_simd_blend_span_u32(")
expect(source).to_contain("rt_engine2d_simd_blend_const_span_u32(")
expect(source.contains("var dst_row: [u32]")).to_equal(false)
expect(source.contains("var src_row: [u32]")).to_equal(false)
expect(source.contains("engine2d_simd_blend_row_u32(")).to_equal(false)
# Cross-ISA selection is governed by native evidence, not an x86-only
# production branch; enabled AArch64/RISC-V runtimes use the same ABI.
expect(source.contains("active_arch_text() == \"x86_64\"")).to_equal(false)
```

</details>

